  "contentHtml": "<p>1. <a href=\"https://x.com/dwarkesh_sp/status/2115848725742354717\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Dwarkesh interviews Robert Caro</a> (!).</p>\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://www.nbcnews.com/health/health-news/study-estimates-75-nfl-players-died-15-year-span-may-cte-rcna605975\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">New and pretty brutal results on CTE and football</a>.</p>\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://britishprogress.substack.com/p/dan-wang-on-stinky-fish-productive?utm_campaign=post-expanded-share&amp;utm_medium=web\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Interview with Dan Wang</a>.</p>\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://saez-zucman-audit-replication.vercel.app/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Updated version of the Saez-Zucman audit</a>.&nbsp; Contestable and speculative assumptions are now separated from true defects.</p>\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://econjwatch.org/podcast/gregory-clark-on-the-determinants-of-social-status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Rosalind Arden interviews Greg Clark on social status</a>.</p>\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://labs.ycombinator.com/projects/games/index.html#mindustry-what-we-saw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GPTs vs. Claudes, in games</a>.</p>\n<p>7. <a href=\"https://x.com/cryptopunk7213/status/2115886307859714441?s=46\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The latest from Sam Altman</a>.</p>",
